      "receiptSource": "The original source of this receipt isn\u0027t known. Can you help? \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:editor@foodsofengland.co.uk?subject=Foods%20of%20England,%20Sussex%20Plum%20Duffs\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Eeditor@foodsofengland.co.uk\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ESussex Plum Duffs\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\n55g lard\u003Cbr\u003E\n2 cups of flour\u003Cbr\u003E\n55g currants or sultanas\u003Cbr\u003E\n27g castor sugar\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 cup of milk (soured)\u003Cbr\u003E\nLemon\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nSour the milk by adding the juice of half a lemon.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nRub the lard into the flour, add the fruit and sugar, and then the milk. Work the mixture into a pastry.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nRoll out and cut into rounds, brush with milk, bake in a moderate oven for 15 minutes.\u003Cbr\u003E"
    }
